      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the air fryer to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper",
    "Add the lamb cubes to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade",
    "Thread the lamb cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece",
    "Sprinkle the crushed juniper berries over the lamb",
    "Cook the kebabs in the air fryer for 10-12 minutes, or until cooked to desired doneness",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro"
  ],
